# Text is stored and checked out as LF everywhere (K22-CODE-07), matching
# .editorconfig (end_of_line = lf) so the dotnet format gate behaves the same at
# developers' desks and on CI runners regardless of their git config. Windows-only
# script formats that require CRLF are the exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
